#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:516
msgid ""
"If the whole download speed of every torrent is lower than SPEED, aria2 "
"temporarily increases the number of peers to try for more download speed. "
"Configuring this option with your preferred download speed can increase your"
" download speed in some cases."
msgstr ""
"Hvis hele nedlastingshastigheten for hver torrent er lavere enn HASTIGHET, "
"øker aria2 midlertidig antall jevnaldrende for å prøve for høyere "
"nedlastingshastighet. Konfigurering av dette alternativet med din foretrukne"
" nedlastingshastighet kan øke nedlastingshastigheten i noen tilfeller."

