msgstr "Oppdater hvert %s sekund."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:459
msgid "Remove unselected file"
msgstr "Fjern uvalgt fil"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:460
msgid ""
"Removes the unselected files when download is completed in BitTorrent. "
"Please use this option with care because it will actually remove files from "
"your disk."
msgstr ""
"Fjerner de umarkerte filene når nedlastingen er fullført i BitTorrent. "
"Vennligst bruk dette alternativet med forsiktighet fordi det faktisk vil "
"fjerne filer fra disken din."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:514
msgid "Request peer speed limit"
msgstr "Be om fartsgrense for jevnaldrende"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:403
msgid "Retry wait"
msgstr "Prøv å vente på nytt"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:209
msgid "Run daemon as user"
msgstr "Kjør daemon som bruker"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:194
msgid "Running Status"
msgstr "Kjørestatus"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:566
msgid ""
"Save a control file (*.aria2) every N seconds. If 0 is given, a control file"
" is not saved during download."
msgstr ""
"Lagre en kontrollfil (*.aria2) hvert N sekund. Hvis 0 er gitt, lagres ikke "
"en kontrollfil under nedlasting."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:598
msgid ""
"Save download to session file even if the download is completed or removed. "
"This option also saves control file in that situations. This may be useful "
"to save BitTorrent seeding which is recognized as completed state."
msgstr ""
"Lagre nedlastingen til øktfilen selv om nedlastingen er fullført eller "
"fjernet. Dette alternativet lagrer også kontrollfilen i slike situasjoner. "
"Dette kan være nyttig for å lagre BitTorrent seeding som er anerkjent som "
"fullført tilstand."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:572
msgid ""
"Save error/unfinished downloads to session file every N seconds. If 0 is "
"given, file will be saved only when aria2 exits."
msgstr ""
"Lagre feil/uferdige nedlastinger til øktfil hvert N sekund. Hvis 0 er gitt, "
"vil filen bare lagres når aria2 avsluttes."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:453
msgid ""
"Save meta data as \".torrent\" file. This option has effect only when "
"BitTorrent Magnet URI is used. The file name is hex encoded info hash with "
"suffix \".torrent\"."
msgstr ""
"Lagre metadata som \".torrent\"-fil. Dette alternativet har effekt bare når "
"BitTorrent Magnet URI brukes. Filnavnet er hekskodet info-hash med suffikset"
" \".torrent\"."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:452
msgid "Save metadata"
msgstr "Lagre metadata"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:571
msgid "Save session interval"
msgstr "Lagre øktintervall"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:467
msgid "Seed previously downloaded files without verifying piece hashes."
msgstr "Seed tidligere nedlastede filer uten å verifisere bit-hasher."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:538
msgid "Seed ratio"
msgstr "Frøforhold"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:545
msgid "Seed time"
msgstr "Frøtid"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:466
msgid "Seed unverified"
msgstr "Frø ubekreftet"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:348
msgid ""
"Send <code>Accept: deflate, gzip</code> request header and inflate response "
"if remote server responds with <code>Content-Encoding: gzip</code> or "
"<code>Content-Encoding: deflate</code>."
msgstr ""
"Send <code>Godta: deflate, gzip</code> forespørselshode og blås opp svar "
"hvis ekstern server svarer med <code>Content-Encoding: gzip</code> eller "
"<code>Content-Encoding: deflate</code>."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:357
msgid ""
"Send <code>Cache-Control: no-cache</code> and <code>Pragma: no-cache</code> "
"header to avoid cached content. If disabled, these headers are not sent and "
"you can add Cache-Control header with a directive you like using \"Header\" "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Send <code>Cache-Control: no-cache</code> og <code>Pragma: no-cache</code> "
"header for å unngå bufret innhold. Hvis de er deaktivert, sendes ikke disse "
"overskriftene, og du kan legge til Cache-Control-overskriften med et "
"direktiv du liker ved å bruke \"Header\"-alternativet."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:473
msgid ""
"Set TCP port number for BitTorrent downloads. Accept format: \"6881,6885\", "
"\"6881-6999\" and \"6881-6889,6999\". Make sure that the specified ports are"
" open for incoming TCP traffic."
msgstr ""
"Angi TCP-portnummer for BitTorrent-nedlastinger. Godta format: "
"\"6881,6885\", \"6881-6999\" og \"6881-6889,6999\". Sørg for at de angitte "
"portene er åpne for innkommende TCP-trafikk."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:479
msgid ""
"Set UDP listening port used by DHT (IPv4, IPv6) and UDP tracker. Make sure "
"that the specified ports are open for incoming UDP traffic."
msgstr ""
"Angi UDP-lytteport som brukes av DHT (IPv4, IPv6) og UDP-sporer. Sørg for at"
" de angitte portene er åpne for innkommende UDP-trafikk."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:614
msgid ""
"Set max download speed per each download in bytes/sec. 0 means unrestricted."
msgstr ""
"Angi maksimal nedlastingshastighet per hver nedlasting i byte/sek. 0 betyr "
"ubegrenset."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:607
msgid "Set max overall download speed in bytes/sec. 0 means unrestricted."
msgstr ""
"Angi maksimal total nedlastingshastighet i byte/sek. 0 betyr ubegrenset."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:492
msgid "Set max overall upload speed in bytes/sec. 0 means unrestricted."
msgstr ""
"Angi maksimal total opplastingshastighet i byte/sek. 0 betyr ubegrenset."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:499
msgid ""
"Set max upload speed per each torrent in bytes/sec. 0 means unrestricted."
msgstr ""
"Angi maksimal opplastingshastighet per hver torrent i byte/sek. 0 betyr "
"ubegrenset."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:368
msgid ""
"Set the connect timeout in seconds to establish connection to HTTP/FTP/proxy"
" server. After the connection is established, this option makes no effect "
"and \"Timeout\" option is used instead."
msgstr ""
"Angi tidsavbrudd for tilkobling i sekunder for å etablere tilkobling til "
"HTTP/FTP/proxy-server. Etter at tilkoblingen er opprettet, har dette "
"alternativet ingen effekt, og alternativet \"Timeout\" brukes i stedet."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:404
msgid "Set the seconds to wait between retries."
msgstr "Still inn sekunder for å vente mellom gjenforsøk."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:409
msgid "Set user agent for HTTP(S) downloads."
msgstr "Angi brukeragent for HTTP(S)-nedlastinger."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:188
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Innstillinger"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:620
msgid "Settings in this section will be added to config file."
msgstr "Innstillinger i denne delen vil bli lagt til i konfigurasjonsfilen."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:624
msgid "Settings list"
msgstr "Innstillingsliste"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:585
msgid ""
"Specify file allocation method. If you are using newer file systems such as "
"ext4 (with extents support), btrfs, xfs or NTFS (MinGW build only), "
"\"falloc\" is your best choice. It allocates large(few GiB) files almost "
"instantly, but it may not be available if your system doesn't have "
"posix_fallocate(3) function. Don't use \"falloc\" with legacy file systems "
"such as ext3 and FAT32 because it takes almost same time as \"prealloc\" and"
" it blocks aria2 entirely until allocation finishes."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiser filallokeringsmetode. Hvis du bruker nyere filsystemer som ext4 "
"(med omfangsstøtte), btrfs, xfs eller NTFS (kun MinGW build), er \"falloc\" "
"ditt beste valg. Den tildeler store (få GiB) filer nesten umiddelbart, men "
"den er kanskje ikke tilgjengelig hvis systemet ditt ikke har funksjonen "
"posix_fallocate(3). Ikke bruk \"falloc\" med eldre filsystemer som ext3 og "
"FAT32 fordi det tar nesten samme tid som \"prealloc\" og det blokkerer aria2"
" helt til allokeringen er ferdig."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:505
msgid ""
"Specify maximum number of files to open in multi-file BitTorrent download "
"globally."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiser maksimalt antall filer som skal åpnes i BitTorrent-nedlasting med"
" flere filer globalt."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:546
msgid ""
"Specify seeding time in minutes. If \"Seed ratio\" option is specified along"
" with this option, seeding ends when at least one of the conditions is "
"satisfied. Specifying 0 disables seeding after download completed."
msgstr ""
"Angi såtid i minutter. Hvis alternativet \"Seed ratio\" er spesifisert "
"sammen med dette alternativet, avsluttes seeding når minst én av "
"betingelsene er oppfylt. Hvis du spesifiserer 0, deaktiveres seeding etter "
"at nedlastingen er fullført."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:539
msgid ""
"Specify share ratio. Seed completed torrents until share ratio reaches "
"RATIO. You are strongly encouraged to specify equals or more than 1.0 here. "
"Specify 0.0 if you intend to do seeding regardless of share ratio."
msgstr ""
"Angi andelsforhold. Seed fullførte torrents til andelsforholdet når RATIO. "
"Du oppfordres sterkt til å angi lik eller mer enn 1,0 her. Spesifiser 0.0 "
"hvis du har tenkt å seeding uavhengig av andelsforhold."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:510
msgid "Specify the maximum number of peers per torrent, 0 means unlimited."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiser maksimalt antall jevnaldrende per torrent, 0 betyr ubegrenset."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:531
msgid ""
"Specify the prefix of peer ID. The peer ID in BitTorrent is 20 byte length. "
"If more than 20 bytes are specified, only first 20 bytes are used. If less "
"than 20 bytes are specified, random byte data are added to make its length "
"20 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiser prefikset til peer-ID. Peer-IDen i BitTorrent er 20 byte lengde. "
"Hvis mer enn 20 byte er spesifisert, brukes kun de første 20 bytene. Hvis "
"mindre enn 20 byte er spesifisert, legges tilfeldige bytedata til for å "
"gjøre lengden 20 byte."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:525
msgid ""
"Stop BitTorrent download if download speed is 0 in consecutive N seconds. If"
" 0 is given, this feature is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Stopp BitTorrent-nedlastingen hvis nedlastingshastigheten er 0 i påfølgende "
"N sekunder. Hvis 0 er gitt, er denne funksjonen deaktivert."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:524
msgid "Stop timeout"
msgstr "Stopp timeout"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:36
msgid "The Aria2 service is not running."
msgstr "Aria2-tjenesten kjører ikke."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:35
msgid "The Aria2 service is running."
msgstr "Aria2-tjenesten kjører."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:217
msgid "The directory to store the config file, session file and DHT file."
msgstr "Katalogen for å lagre konfigurasjonsfilen, sesjonsfilen og DHT-filen."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:213
msgid ""
"The directory to store the downloaded file. For example "
"<code>/mnt/sda1</code>."
msgstr ""
"Katalogen for å lagre den nedlastede filen. For eksempel "
"<code>/mnt/sda1</code>."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:224
msgid "The file name of the log file."
msgstr "Filnavnet til loggfilen."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:386
msgid "The maximum number of connections to one server for each download."
msgstr "Maksimalt antall tilkoblinger til én server for hver nedlasting."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:418
#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:428
#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:436
#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:445
msgid "This option will be ignored if a private flag is set in a torrent."
msgstr ""
"Dette alternativet vil bli ignorert hvis et privat flagg er satt i en "
"torrent."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:373
msgid "Timeout"
msgstr "Tidsavbrudd"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:260
msgid "Token"
msgstr "Token"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:486
msgid "True"
msgstr "ekte"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:310
msgid "Use a proxy server for all protocols."
msgstr "Bruk en proxy-server for alle protokoller."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:330
msgid ""
"Use the certificate authorities in FILE to verify the peers. The certificate"
" file must be in PEM format and can contain multiple CA certificates."
msgstr ""
"Bruk sertifikatmyndighetene i FILE for å verifisere likemennene. "
"Sertifikatfilen må være i PEM-format og kan inneholde flere CA-sertifikater."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:284
msgid ""
"Use the certificate in FILE for RPC server. The certificate must be either "
"in PKCS12 (.p12, .pfx) or in PEM format.<br/>PKCS12 files must contain the "
"certificate, a key and optionally a chain of additional certificates. Only "
"PKCS12 files with a blank import password can be opened!<br/>When using PEM,"
" you have to specify the \"RPC private key\" as well."
msgstr ""
"Bruk sertifikatet i FILE for RPC-server. Sertifikatet må enten være i PKCS12"
" (.p12, .pfx) eller i PEM-format.<br/>PKCS12-filer må inneholde "
"sertifikatet, en nøkkel og eventuelt en kjede av tilleggssertifikater. Bare "
"PKCS12-filer med et tomt importpassord kan åpnes!<br/>Når du bruker PEM, må "
"du spesifisere \"RPC private key\" også."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:335
msgid ""
"Use the client certificate in FILE. The certificate must be either in PKCS12"
" (.p12, .pfx) or in PEM format.<br/>PKCS12 files must contain the "
"certificate, a key and optionally a chain of additional certificates. Only "
"PKCS12 files with a blank import password can be opened!<br/>When using PEM,"
" you have to specify the \"Private key\" as well."
msgstr ""
"Bruk klientsertifikatet i FILE. Sertifikatet må enten være i PKCS12 (.p12, "
".pfx) eller i PEM-format.<br/>PKCS12-filer må inneholde sertifikatet, en "
"nøkkel og eventuelt en kjede av tilleggssertifikater. Bare PKCS12-filer med "
"et tomt importpassord kan åpnes!<br/>Når du bruker PEM, må du spesifisere "
"\"Privatnøkkelen\" også."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:294
msgid ""
"Use the private key in FILE for RPC server. The private key must be "
"decrypted and in PEM format."
msgstr ""
"Bruk den private nøkkelen i FILE for RPC-server. Den private nøkkelen må "
"være dekryptert og i PEM-format."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:342
msgid ""
"Use the private key in FILE. The private key must be decrypted and in PEM "
"format. The behavior when encrypted one is given is undefined."
msgstr ""
"Bruk den private nøkkelen i FILE. Den private nøkkelen må være dekryptert og"
" i PEM-format. Atferden når kryptert en er gitt er udefinert."

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:408
msgid "User agent"
msgstr "Brukeragent"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:259
msgid "Username & Password"
msgstr "Brukernavn og passord"

#: applications/luci-app-aria2/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aria2/config.js:323
msgid "Verify the peer using certificates specified in \"CA certificate\" option."
msgstr ""
"Bekreft peeren ved å bruke sertifikater spesifisert i alternativet \"CA-"
"sertifikat\"."

